# BAWAAL sport taxonomy (LOCKED)

Canonical list lives in `src/constants/sports.js` as **`BAWAAL_SPORTS`** (re-exported from `src/utils/sportCategory.js` as `BAWAAL_SPORT_TAXONOMY` / `BAWAAL_FORM_SPORTS` / `ARENA_SPORT_TABS`). This is locked core architecture — see `BAWAAL_MASTER_BLUEPRINT.md` §2–3.

## Exact order (do not reorder or rename)

1. ALL  
2. CRICKET  
3. FOOTBALL  
4. GYM  
5. KABADDI  
6. COMBAT  
7. THROTTLE  
8. WAVE & BLADE  
9. COURT KINGS  
10. SKY & SUMMIT  
11. OTHERS  

## UI pattern (LOCKED)

Sport interest / filter chips are a **single-line horizontal** `ScrollView` of pills importing `BAWAAL_SPORTS` (or a documented re-export). Never invent local sport arrays or wrap into multi-row grids.

## Consumers (must import shared constants — no local sport arrays)

- Landing Sport Interest — `RoleSelection` (`SPORT_INTERESTS = BAWAAL_SPORTS`)
- Post Squad Brief — `BawaalPromptModal` (`SQUAD_BRIEF_SPORTS` re-export)
- Create Battle — `CreateBattleSheet`
- Arena publish — `PostCreationSheet` via `ARENA_SPORT_OPTIONS` (excludes ALL)
- Upload challenge category — `UploadScreen`
- Arena / BATTLES sport filters — `ARENA_SPORT_TABS` / `BAWAAL_SPORTS`
- GAME ON live scores pills — `ScoresSportsPanel` / `GameOnHub` via `BAWAAL_SPORTS` only (never Tennis, Badminton, Baseball, or other fallbacks)
- Sport Hub Map category pills — may add ALL / SPORTS SPOTS chrome but sport keys must match taxonomy (see `bawaal-sport-hub-map-locked.mdc`)

## Accent

Single-select highlight on Post Squad Brief uses electric purple `#A855F7` (POST theme). Other forms may use their surface accents but keep the same labels.
